  "description": "One day, a statuesquely handsome man named Hyuk-Jin, who claims to be the president of the company where his father worked, visits Da-Ram, who lost his parents at a young age and lives alone in the countryside. He offers to take Da-Ram away, claiming it was Da-Ram's father's last request. A bewildered Da-Ram refuses, claiming he can't trust him. Hyuk-Jin then proposes a one-week cohabitation.\n\n *\"Please give me a chance.\"*\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
